title: StairsLanding
---
// Talk target of the stairs on the landing (Interact layer). On the second Thursday they
// lead down to the corner shop, a separate area of the map (shop.yarn).
-> Go down to the shop <<if visited("Route1Thu2Start") and not visited("Route1Thu2Door")>>
    <<fade_out>>
    <<place Player ShopIn>>
    <<face Player up>>
    <<fade_in>>
-> Look
    <<if visited("Route1Thu2Start") and not visited("Route1Thu2Door")>>
        You: The corner shop's at the bottom of the street. Open till ten.
    <<else>>
        You: Three floors of stairs. No lift. I carried every box up these.
    <<endif>>
===
